  "review_method": "Every rendered page was viewed as an image (the pdftoppm PNGs, opened one by one). The first full render (136 pages) was viewed in full; it showed a stale forward reference at the end of AV2 (page 20), an equation tag pushed to its own line and the Round11 weight rho colliding with the residual norm rho (page 109), small example fractions (page 114) and tight longtable rows (pages 129-133). After those fixes pages 20-33 and 108-137 were re-rendered and viewed again; the other 93 final page images are byte-identical (SHA-256) to the images viewed in the first pass. A final rebuild reproduced the same PDF and page images byte for byte.",
